NV-Reason-CT third-party notices
================================

This file attributes third-party open-source software used by this
repository. It is an attribution notice, not a license file.

There is no vendored `vendor/` / `third_party/` tree. Direct package
dependencies are installed from PyPI via `requirements.txt` and
`requirements-train.txt`. One training file is an NVIDIA adaptation of
upstream TRL source (copied/adapted into the tree).

License identifiers below come from the package's PyPI metadata
(`license`, `license_expression`, or OSI classifier) at the time this
file was written. Transitive dependencies are not listed.

