https://github.com/huggingface/trl
Copyright 2020-2026 The HuggingFace Team. All rights reserved.
Licensed under Apache-2.0
https://github.com/huggingface/trl/blob/v1.2.0/LICENSE

Adapted file: train/vlm_grpo_trainer.py
Upstream: https://github.com/huggingface/trl/blob/v1.2.0/trl/trainer/grpo_trainer.py

NVIDIA retained the upstream Apache-2.0 copyright notice and added an
NVIDIA OpenMDW-1.1 header below it. Relative to stock TRL 1.2.0
GRPOTrainer, this file changes 3D `images3d=` processor routing,
5D `pixel_values` slicing during chunked log-prob computation,
chat-template image placeholders for Qwen3.5, and suppression of
reserved multimodal control-token IDs while sampling.

